---
import Layout from '../../layouts/RealestateLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Sell Your Home in the GTA | Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent | Trustwell Realty"
  description="Thinking about selling in Toronto, Markham, or Richmond Hill? Cory Wong offers pricing strategy, MLS listing, and offer negotiation. Get a free home valuation."
  canonicalPath="/sell"
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">Sell Your Home in the GTA</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__subtitle">
        Selling well comes down to three things: pricing it right, presenting it well, and
        negotiating from a position of strength. I handle all three.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Cory Provides -->
  <section class="seller-services">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="section-heading">What Cory Provides</h2>
      <ul class="service-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Comparative market analysis (CMA)</strong> &mdash; a data-driven pricing
          strategy based on recent comparable sales, current inventory, and neighbourhood
          trends so your home is priced to attract serious buyers.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Preparation guidance</strong> &mdash; practical recommendations on staging,
          decluttering, repairs, and curb appeal to help your property show at its best
          without overspending.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Professional photography and MLS listing</strong> &mdash; high-quality photos,
          compelling listing copy, and full exposure on the MLS and major real estate portals
          so your listing reaches the widest possible audience.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Digital marketing</strong> &mdash; targeted online promotion across social
          media, email campaigns, and real estate networks to drive qualified buyer traffic
          to your listing.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Offer review and negotiation</strong> &mdash; I analyze every offer, explain
          the terms in plain language, and negotiate to protect your interests and maximize
          your net proceeds.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Lawyer coordination and closing support</strong> &mdash; I manage the details
          from accepted offer through closing, coordinating with lawyers, the buyer's agent,
          and any other parties to keep the transaction on track.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing Strategy -->
  <section class="pricing-strategy">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Pricing Strategy</h2>
      <p class="body-text">
        Pricing is the single most important decision you'll make when selling. I prepare a
        detailed comparative market analysis (CMA) that examines recent sold prices, active
        listings, days on market, and neighbourhood-specific trends to arrive at a price
        that reflects your home's true market value.
      </p>
      <p class="body-text">
        Depending on the property and market conditions, we'll discuss two primary approaches:
      </p>
      <div class="strategy-cards">
        <div class="strategy-card">
          <h3 class="strategy-card__title">Hold-Back Strategy</h3>
          <p class="strategy-card__text">
            Price slightly below market value, hold offers to a set date, and generate
            competition among buyers. This works best in high-demand neighbourhoods and
            balanced-to-seller markets where multiple offers are likely.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="strategy-card">
          <h3 class="strategy-card__title">Straightforward Pricing</h3>
          <p class="strategy-card__text">
            Price at or near fair market value and review offers as they come in. This
            approach suits slower markets or properties where transparent pricing builds
            buyer confidence and reduces time on market.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing-note">
        <p>
          <strong>The risk of overpricing:</strong> A home priced too high sits on the market,
          accumulates days on market, and often sells for less than it would have at the right
          price from the start. Buyers and their agents track listings closely &mdash; a price
          reduction signals desperation and weakens your negotiating position. Getting the price
          right on day one matters more than any other factor.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The GTA Listing Process -->
  <section class="process">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="section-heading">The GTA Listing Process</h2>
      <ol class="process-steps">
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">1</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Listing Consultation</h3>
            <p>
              We meet to review your goals, timeline, and property. I walk through the CMA,
              explain the pricing strategy options, and outline what to expect at every stage
              of the process.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">2</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Preparation</h3>
            <p>
              Based on the consultation, I provide a preparation checklist covering staging,
              decluttering, minor repairs, and any improvements that will deliver a strong
              return. The goal is to present your home at its best without unnecessary expense.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">3</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Photography and Marketing</h3>
            <p>
              A professional photographer captures your home. I write the listing copy,
              publish it on the MLS and major portals, and launch a targeted digital
              marketing campaign to drive buyer interest.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">4</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>On Market</h3>
            <p>
              Your listing goes live. I manage showings, collect buyer feedback, and keep
              you updated with regular reports on activity, market response, and any
              adjustments we should consider.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">5</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Offers</h3>
            <p>
              When offers come in, I review every term &mdash; price, conditions, deposit,
              closing date &mdash; and explain the trade-offs in plain language. I negotiate
              on your behalf to secure the best possible outcome.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">6</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Accepted Offer Through Closing</h3>
            <p>
              Once an offer is accepted, I coordinate with the buyer's agent, lawyers, and
              any other parties to ensure conditions are met, paperwork is completed, and
              the transaction closes smoothly and on time.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Seller Valuation Form -->
  <section class="valuation" id="valuation">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Find Out What Your Home Is Worth</h2>
      <p class="valuation__intro">
        Request a free, no-obligation home valuation. I'll review comparable sales in your
        area and provide a clear estimate of your property's current market value.
      </p>
      <form id="seller-form" class="lead-form" novalidate>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="seller-name">Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="seller-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="seller-email">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="seller-email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="seller-address">Property Address</label>
          <input type="text" id="seller-address" name="address" required placeholder="e.g. 123 Main Street, Markham, ON" autocomplete="street-address" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="seller-timeline">Timeline</label>
          <select id="seller-timeline" name="timeline">
            <option value="">Select a timeline</option>
            <option value="ASAP">ASAP</option>
            <option value="1-3 months">1&ndash;3 months</option>
            <option value="3-6 months">3&ndash;6 months</option>
            <option value="6-12 months">6&ndash;12 months</option>
            <option value="Just curious">Just curious</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="seller-notes">Notes</label>
          <textarea id="seller-notes" name="notes" rows="4" placeholder="Anything else I should know — property type, recent renovations, questions..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="cta cta--primary form-submit">Get a Free Home Valuation</button>
        <p id="seller-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="cta-banner__title">Want to Talk Through Your Situation First?</h2>
      <p class="cta-banner__text">
        Book a free, no-obligation consultation and let's discuss your options.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="cta cta--primary">Book a Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Newsletter Signup -->
  <section class="newsletter">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="newsletter__heading">Get the GTA Market Report Each Month</h2>
      <p class="newsletter__text">
        Stay informed with monthly market data, neighbourhood insights, and practical advice
        for buyers and sellers across the Greater Toronto Area.
      </p>
      <form id="newsletter-form" class="newsletter__form" novalidate>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="newsletter-email"
          name="email"
          placeholder="you@example.com"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          class="newsletter__input"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="cta cta--primary newsletter__btn">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
      <p id="newsletter-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  // Seller valuation form
  const sellerForm = document.getElementById('seller-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const sellerStatus = document.getElementById('seller-form-status');

  if (sellerForm && sellerStatus) {
    sellerForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      sellerStatus.textContent = '';
      sellerStatus.className = 'form-status';

      const formData = new FormData(sellerForm);
      const payload = {
        type: 'seller',
        name: formData.get('name'),
        email: formData.get('email'),
        address: formData.get('address'),
        timeline: formData.get('timeline'),
        notes: formData.get('notes'),
      };

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/lead', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          sellerStatus.textContent = 'Thank you! I\'ll review comparable sales in your area and be in touch within one business day.';
          sellerStatus.classList.add('form-status--success');
          sellerForm.reset();
        } else {
          throw new Error('Request failed');
        }
      } catch {
        sellerStatus.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again or email me directly.';
        sellerStatus.classList.add('form-status--error');
      }
    });
  }

  // Newsletter form
  const newsletterForm = document.getElementById('newsletter-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const newsletterStatus = document.getElementById('newsletter-form-status');

  if (newsletterForm && newsletterStatus) {
    newsletterForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      newsletterStatus.textContent = '';
      newsletterStatus.className = 'form-status';

      const formData = new FormData(newsletterForm);
      const payload = {
        type: 'newsletter',
        email: formData.get('email'),
      };

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/lead', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          newsletterStatus.textContent = 'You\'re subscribed! Watch your inbox for the next report.';
          newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--success');
          newsletterForm.reset();
        } else {
          throw new Error('Request failed');
        }
      } catch {
        newsletterStatus.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
        newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--error');
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  /* Content width */
  .content-narrow {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .page-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Section Heading */
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  /* Seller Services */
  .seller-services {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .service-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .service-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
    position: relative;
  }

  .service-list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.55em;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .service-list li strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  /* Pricing Strategy */
  .pricing-strategy {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: #f5f5f4;
  }

  .body-text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .strategy-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .strategy-card {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .strategy-card__title {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .strategy-card__text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .pricing-note {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .pricing-note p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .pricing-note strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  /* Process Steps */
  .process {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
  }

  .process-steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .process-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .process-step__number {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .process-step__content h3 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .process-step__content p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Valuation Form */
  .valuation {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: #f5f5f4;
  }

  .valuation__intro {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .lead-form {
    max-width: 32rem;
  }

  .form-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .form-group label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .form-group input,
  .form-group select,
  .form-group textarea {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .form-group input:focus,
  .form-group select:focus,
  .form-group textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.1);
  }

  .form-group textarea {
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .form-submit {
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .form-status {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    min-height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .form-status--success {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .form-status--error {
    color: #b91c1c;
  }

  /* CTA Buttons */
  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cta--primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cta--primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* CTA Banner */
  .cta-banner {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cta-banner__title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .cta-banner__text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  /* Newsletter */
  .newsletter {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .newsletter__heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .newsletter__form {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .newsletter__input {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__input::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .newsletter__input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #ffffff;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  .newsletter__btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .newsletter__btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--success {
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--error {
    color: #fecaca;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .form-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .strategy-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .newsletter__form {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
